\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Available gating-institution output per 100,000 EU/EC population, 1960--2025. The coloured series use each institution's own reported output measure; the population denominator is the EU/EC member-state population at each date, with enlargement and Brexit breaks. The dark red line is a chained median index of per-capita growth (right axis, 1960 = 100); it uses only observed year-to-year pairs and therefore does not jump when a series enters or leaves.}}{11}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
